<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-11T11:43:38.252Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:43:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes have intensified in Kordofan, Blue Nile and Darfur, with recent drone strikes killing dozens of civilians, including a strike that killed 41 people near the Ethiopian border and another that killed 30 in the Blue Nile region. Intercommunal violence in South Sudan has also resulted in high casualties, while the UN has condemned attacks on displacement camps and extended the Darfur arms embargo, rejecting broader sanctions. These developments follow a conflict that has already caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP, and represent a sharp escalation in aerial attacks and humanitarian concerns since the last briefing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8vgx9ew571wo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQZmlic3BqamlLOUo5NllTUUp4SlNiWUwyRWdveDN3cUVqRTBua29oTVM5T25XRmZqdUx4V0RKQloxRElRQnR2TGViejl0VV9iMWE5QmpNd1p5OTNvNkxmR2VrQ1dFYk5SRXU0ZG9wWUoxZm9CbFBZVlNKTXVQb2ZtelJia2lIeFNrVVk5UmJmaVZwc3p4LXFHenVyMHplVDVUeGd0al82UzVzdGZGUTV3eklKQjN4SFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5TVzRaQXdvUlo5MkVLd00zb1E2WWpDUERYczFHOXV5YlZNWEVSbFlJRnY0Q0xXS2tWb2lYSV90YW42VXNZYm9CZVM3eUxhaFdCbjBNUFhNNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFAtLTFzb3ZHeElVMEpkMXJSUFJYbmx0dndZOHJxUjE5S2pS